{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a <strong>special battlefield</strong> where only the strongest survive!<br>In this fast-paced action game, you\u2019ll <strong>select a unique character</strong>, each infused with their own <strong>DNA abilities</strong>, and enter an intense multiplayer arena filled with chaos and opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fight to win</strong> by battling other players, collecting coins, and climbing the leaderboard. Use your coins to <strong>unlock powerful new characters</strong> \u2014 each with different stats, powers, and playstyles. The more you fight, the more you earn. The more you earn, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the top and become the <strong>richest and most feared warrior</strong> on the battlefield?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fast-paced multiplayer battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>DNA-based character system</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn and collect coins</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Unlock and buy new characters</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350870?t=1772826219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350870?t=1772826219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350870/455d3433658863a6e59c4fdee586b8c27c3ddf4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772826219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350870/455d3433658863a6e59c4fdee586b8c27c3ddf4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772826219","categories":[{"description":"Multi-pla